{"seq":2,"slug":"complex-queries","title":"复杂查询与子查询","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/complex-queries","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"复杂查询与子查询\">复杂查询与子查询</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>复杂查询的核心是把<strong>一个查询的结果作为另一个查询的输入</strong>，以及用命名块来组织多步骤的逻辑。本文围绕四条主线展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>子查询</strong>——嵌套在外层语句内部的查询，可按返回值（标量 / 行 / 表）与执行方式（非关联 / 关联）分类</li>\n<li><strong>EXISTS 与 IN</strong>——都存在性判断，但 NULL 语义与性能倾向不同</li>\n<li><strong>CTE</strong>——用 <code>WITH</code> 给中间结果命名，提升可读性与复用性，并支持递归</li>\n<li><strong>子查询改写</strong>——把关联子查询重写为 JOIN + 聚合，换取更可控的执行计划</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"子查询概述\">子查询概述</h2><p>子查询（Subquery）是嵌套在另一个 SQL 语句内部的查询。根据执行方式和返回结果的不同，子查询可以分为多种类型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[子查询] --&gt; B[按返回值分类]&#10;    A --&gt; C[按执行方式分类]&#10;    B --&gt; D[标量子查询]&#10;    B --&gt; E[行子查询]&#10;    B --&gt; F[表子查询]&#10;    C --&gt; G[非关联子查询]&#10;    C --&gt; H[关联子查询]\">graph TD\n    A[子查询] --&gt; B[按返回值分类]\n    A --&gt; C[按执行方式分类]\n    B --&gt; D[标量子查询]\n    B --&gt; E[行子查询]\n    B --&gt; F[表子查询]\n    C --&gt; G[非关联子查询]\n    C --&gt; H[关联子查询]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类方式</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>标量子查询</td>\n<td>返回单个值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>行子查询</td>\n<td>返回单行多列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>返回值</td>\n<td>表子查询</td>\n<td>返回多行多列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行方式</td>\n<td>非关联子查询</td>\n<td>独立执行，不依赖外层查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行方式</td>\n<td>关联子查询</td>\n<td>依赖外层查询的值，逐行执行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"非关联子查询\">非关联子查询</h2><p>非关联子查询可以独立于外层查询执行，执行引擎只需运行一次子查询即可。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 标量子查询：查找工资高于平均值的员工&#10;SELECT name, salary&#10;FROM employee&#10;WHERE salary &gt; (SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employee);&#10;&#10;-- 表子查询：查找属于研发部门的员工&#10;SELECT name, dept_id&#10;FROM employee&#10;WHERE dept_id IN (SELECT dept_id FROM department WHERE dept_name = &#39;研发&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 标量子查询：查找工资高于平均值的员工</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 表子查询：查找属于研发部门的员工</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '研发'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关联子查询\">关联子查询</h2><p>关联子查询引用了外层查询的列，因此对外层查询的每一行都会执行一次子查询。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 查找每个部门工资最高的员工&#10;SELECT e.name, e.dept_id, e.salary&#10;FROM employee e&#10;WHERE e.salary = (&#10;    SELECT MAX(e2.salary)&#10;    FROM employee e2&#10;    WHERE e2.dept_id = e.dept_id&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 查找每个部门工资最高的员工</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">salary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">salary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关联子查询的执行代价通常较高，当外层结果集较大时应考虑改写为 JOIN。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"exists-与-in\">EXISTS 与 IN</h2><p>EXISTS 和 IN 都可以判断子查询中是否存在匹配的数据，但语义和性能特性不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>IN</th>\n<th>EXISTS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语义</td>\n<td>判断值是否在集合中</td>\n<td>判断子查询是否返回行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NULL 处理</td>\n<td>IN 列表含 NULL 时可能返回未知</td>\n<td>不受 NULL 影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能倾向</td>\n<td>子查询结果集小时更优</td>\n<td>外层结果集小时更优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可改写性</td>\n<td>可改写为 JOIN</td>\n<td>可改写为 JOIN</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- IN：查找有订单的客户&#10;SELECT name FROM customer&#10;WHERE customer_id IN (SELECT customer_id FROM orders);&#10;&#10;-- EXISTS：等价写法&#10;SELECT name FROM customer c&#10;WHERE EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.customer_id = c.customer_id);&#10;&#10;-- NOT EXISTS：查找没有订单的客户&#10;SELECT name FROM customer c&#10;WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM orders o WHERE o.customer_id = c.customer_id);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- IN：查找有订单的客户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- EXISTS：等价写法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- NOT EXISTS：查找没有订单的客户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">customer_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cte-公用表表达式\">CTE（公用表表达式）</h2><p>CTE（Common Table Expression）用 <code>WITH</code> 关键字定义，是子查询的命名版本，提升了复杂查询的可读性和可维护性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH high_salary AS (&#10;    SELECT dept_id, AVG(salary) AS avg_salary&#10;    FROM employee&#10;    GROUP BY dept_id&#10;    HAVING AVG(salary) &gt; 10000&#10;)&#10;SELECT d.dept_name, hs.avg_salary&#10;FROM high_salary hs&#10;JOIN department d ON hs.dept_id = d.dept_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high_salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high_salary hs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> hs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"cte-的优势\">CTE 的优势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>将复杂逻辑拆分为有意义的命名块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用性</td>\n<td>同一个 CTE 可在主查询中多次引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递归能力</td>\n<td>支持递归查询，处理层级数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>作用域明确</td>\n<td>CTE 只在当前语句内有效，不会污染其他查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"递归-cte\">递归 CTE</h2><p>递归 CTE 用于处理层级或图结构的数据，由锚定成员（初始条件）和递归成员（迭代条件）组成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 组织架构：查找某经理下的所有下属&#10;WITH RECURSIVE subordinates AS (&#10;    SELECT emp_id, name, manager_id, 1 AS level&#10;    FROM employee&#10;    WHERE emp_id = 1001&#10;&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;&#10;    SELECT e.emp_id, e.name, e.manager_id, s.level + 1&#10;    FROM employee e&#10;    JOIN subordinates s ON e.manager_id = s.emp_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT emp_id, name, level&#10;FROM subordinates&#10;ORDER BY level, name;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组织架构：查找某经理下的所有下属</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subordinates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, manager_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">emp_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">manager_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subordinates s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">manager_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">emp_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> emp_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">level</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> subordinates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[锚定成员: 初始行] --&gt; B[递归成员: 基于上一轮结果迭代]&#10;    B --&gt; C{是否有新行?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| B&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[合并所有轮次的结果]\">graph TD\n    A[锚定成员: 初始行] --&gt; B[递归成员: 基于上一轮结果迭代]\n    B --&gt; C{是否有新行?}\n    C --&gt;|是| B\n    C --&gt;|否| D[合并所有轮次的结果]</pre><h3 id=\"递归-cte-实战场景\">递归 CTE 实战场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组织架构</td>\n<td>从某节点查询所有下级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分类树</td>\n<td>展开商品类目的完整路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物料清单</td>\n<td>BOM 表的多级展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续日期</td>\n<td>生成一个日期序列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 生成连续日期序列&#10;WITH RECURSIVE date_series AS (&#10;    SELECT DATE(&#39;2024-01-01&#39;) AS dt&#10;    UNION ALL&#10;    SELECT DATE_ADD(dt, INTERVAL 1 DAY)&#10;    FROM date_series&#10;    WHERE dt &lt; &#39;2024-01-31&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT dt FROM date_series;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 生成连续日期序列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> RECURSIVE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_series </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2024-01-01'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    UNION ALL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_ADD(dt, INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DAY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_series</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2024-01-31'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> date_series;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"子查询改写技巧\">子查询改写技巧</h2><p>复杂子查询有时可以改写为 JOIN 以获得更好的性能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 改写前：关联子查询&#10;SELECT name, salary FROM employee e&#10;WHERE salary &gt; (SELECT AVG(salary) FROM employee e2 WHERE e2.dept_id = e.dept_id);&#10;&#10;-- 改写后：JOIN + 聚合&#10;SELECT e.name, e.salary&#10;FROM employee e&#10;JOIN (&#10;    SELECT dept_id, AVG(salary) AS avg_salary&#10;    FROM employee&#10;    GROUP BY dept_id&#10;) dept_avg ON e.dept_id = dept_avg.dept_id&#10;WHERE e.salary &gt; dept_avg.avg_salary;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 改写前：关联子查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 改写后：JOIN + 聚合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) dept_avg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dept_avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dept_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">salary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dept_avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_salary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>非关联子查询</strong>独立执行一次，<strong>关联子查询</strong>逐行执行，性能差异显著</li>\n<li><strong>EXISTS</strong> 适合外层结果集小的场景，<strong>IN</strong> 适合子查询结果集小的场景</li>\n<li><strong>CTE</strong> 极大提升了复杂查询的可读性，推荐在多步骤查询中使用</li>\n<li><strong>递归 CTE</strong> 是处理层级数据的利器，替代了传统的多次自连接</li>\n<li>善于将关联子查询改写为 JOIN 是 SQL 性能优化的重要技巧</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复杂查询与子查询","id":"复杂查询与子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"子查询概述","id":"子查询概述"},{"level":2,"text":"非关联子查询","id":"非关联子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"关联子查询","id":"关联子查询"},{"level":2,"text":"EXISTS 与 IN","id":"exists-与-in"},{"level":2,"text":"CTE（公用表表达式）","id":"cte-公用表表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"CTE 的优势","id":"cte-的优势"},{"level":2,"text":"递归 CTE","id":"递归-cte"},{"level":3,"text":"递归 CTE 实战场景","id":"递归-cte-实战场景"},{"level":2,"text":"子查询改写技巧","id":"子查询改写技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DDL 与 DML","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/ddl-and-dml"},"next":{"title":"聚合窗口函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/sql-mastery/aggregate-window-functions"}}